// Blood, just with W instead of X. Needed to separate gibblet blood from
// from blood spawned when hitting a player/monster. Separated to allow
// an addon that disables blood sprites for competitive play without disabling
// blood trails on gibblets (gibbing an enemy still gotta look cool)
